ML\"><span class=\"space\"> </span></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Açıklamalar</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Explanations</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-12000_New-Business-Relation-row-17 data-input-row alternate-row presentation-enabled\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationTextBlock|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: table-cell;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><div>Şirketimizin devam eden işleri arasında yer alan Pendik-Fevzi Çakmak Metro Projesi'nde 863.000 EUR+KDV tutarında ilave sipariş alınmıştır.&#160;</div><div><br/></div><div>Öte yandan, İşveren ile yapılan fiyat farkı anlaşması çerçevesinde 44.645.758 TL+KDV tutarında fiyat farkı alınacaktır.</div><div><br/></div><div>Bu çerçevede, projenin 9.979.903 EUR+KDV ve 133.751.712 TL+KDV tutarındaki sözleşme büyüklüğü, bahsi geçen ilave sipariş ve İşveren ile yapılan fiyat farkı anlaşması çerçevesinde yeni birim fiyatlarla 10.842.903 EUR+KDV ve 178.397.470 TL+KDV olarak revize edilmiştir.&#160;</div><div><br/></div><div>İşin 31.05.2027 tarihine kadar tamamlanması planlanmaktadır.</div><div><br/></div><div>Kamuoyuna ve Sayın Ortaklarımıza saygı ile duyurulur.</div></div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><div>An additional order in the amount of EUR 863,000 + VAT has been received in connection with the Pendik-Fevzi Çakmak Metro Project, which is among the ongoing projects of our Company.</div><div><br/></div><div>Furthermore, an amount of TRY 44,645,758 + VAT will be received as a price adjustment pursuant to the price adjustment agreement entered into with the Employer.</div><div><br/></div><div>Accordingly, the contract value of the project, which previously amounted to EUR 9,979,903 + VAT and TRY 133,751,712 + VAT, has been revised to EUR 10,842,903 + VAT and TRY 178,397,470 + VAT, respectively, based on the revised unit prices under the aforementioned additional order and the price adjustment agreement entered into with the Employer.</div><div><br/></div><div>The project is scheduled for completion by 31 May 2027.</div><div><br/></div><div>This announcement is hereby made to the public and our esteemed shareholders with due respect.</div><div><br/></div><div>In case of a discrepancy between the Turkish and English versions of this public disclosure statement, the Turkish version shall prevail.</div><div><br/></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>"],"attachments":[]}]